OL,3,AMajor construction ongoing near Iran
OL,4,Amissile bases, satellite images suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran appears to be undertaking
OL,7,Fsignificant new construction near at
OL,8,Fleast two of its major missile sites
OL,9,Fand repairing bases damaged by months
OL,10,Fof US and Israeli air strikes, analysis
OL,11,Fof satellite images suggests.
OL,13,FEvidence of digging and new buildings
OL,14,Fare visible in satellite imagery taken
OL,15,Fin November at the Garmdareh military
OL,16,Fbase in Karaj near the capital Tehran
OL,17,Fand the Shahroud base in the north,
OL,18,Fanalysts at British intelligence
OL,19,Fcompany MAIAR, who reviewed the photos,
OL,20,Ftold BBC Verify.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
