OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMajor construction ongoing near Iran
OL,4,Amissile bases, satellite images suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 other military sites,
OL,7,Fincluding missile complexes and air
OL,8,Fbases, appear to show signs of repairs.
OL,9,FNew roofs have been built on destroyed
OL,10,Fbuildings at the Kermanshah missile
OL,11,Fbase in western Iran, near the border
OL,12,Fwith Iraq, while damaged buildings and
OL,13,Fdebris have been cleared at the Parchin
OL,14,Fmilitary complex - which has been
OL,15,Frepeatedly repaired despite a
OL,16,Fsuccession of air strikes - east of the
OL,17,Fcapital.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1793958971
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMajor construction ongoing near Iran
OL,4,Amissile bases, satellite images suggest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe excavations near Shahroud could
OL,7,Fpotentially be related to the
OL,8,Fproduction of missiles, said Jim
OL,9,FLamson, a former CIA analyst who
OL,10,Ffocused on Iran. He said that because
OL,11,Fthe nearby air base at Shahroud has
OL,12,Fbeen targeted multiple times in recent
OL,13,Fyears, Iran's Islamic Revolutionary
OL,14,FGuards Corps (IRGC) is probably trying
OL,15,Fto find ways to move its production
OL,16,Ffacilities underground.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
